{
  "_readme": [
    "Source list for the bundled cosmetic artwork. Every entry must be public",
    "domain or a licence that allows redistribution — scripts/fetch_cosmetic_art.py",
    "reads the licence back from the source API and refuses anything else, so a",
    "new entry cannot quietly add an encumbered image.",
    "",
    "Keys must match a CosmeticDef key in utils/cosmetics.py. `focus` picks the",
    "crop anchor when the source aspect is taller than the card (top/center/bottom).",
    "Optional `title`/`credit` override what the source API reports (a Japanese object name comes back untranslated); `licence` is never overridable."
  ],
